PROJECT SchoolManagement

TARGET PHP

PROFILE COMPANY_STANDARD

DATABASE MYSQL

AUTH JWT

MODEL Student
    name STRING
    email STRING UNIQUE

MODEL Teacher
    name STRING
    email STRING UNIQUE

MODEL Course
    title STRING
    code STRING UNIQUE
    starts_on DATE

MODEL Enrollment
    grade STRING OPTIONAL

RELATION Teacher HAS_MANY Course
RELATION Course HAS_MANY Enrollment
RELATION Student HAS_MANY Enrollment

VALIDATE email REQUIRED EMAIL
VALIDATE code REQUIRED MAX 16

ROUTE GET /students
ROUTE POST /students
ROUTE GET /teachers
ROUTE POST /teachers
ROUTE GET /courses
ROUTE GET /courses/{id}
ROUTE POST /courses
ROUTE GET /teachers/{id}/courses
ROUTE POST /enrollments
ROUTE GET /students/{id}/enrollments
ROUTE DELETE /enrollments/{id}
